{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇────！愛理、完蛋了啦────！」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sn1422", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，叫得這麼大聲。新吾又去聞美羽的屁股了嗎？」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "ar4428", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚……」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sn1423", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我只是開玩笑，居然說中了啊。」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "ar4429", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管是考試期間還是結束後，社團教室都依然熱鬧。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪又因為貓咪們的行為忽喜忽憂了嗎？", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果牠們真的交配了，不知道她會怎麼樣……", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺接美羽回家之後，新吾就變冷淡了。」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sn1424", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前明明很黏我的，現在卻都跟美羽一起睡……」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sn1425", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為牠們都是貓，這也是沒辦法的吧？比起人類當然比較親同類……」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "ar4430", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然是那樣沒錯……唉。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "sn1426", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那邊的氣氛好像很憂鬱欸。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0652", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說怎麼了，隼太？你會來社團還真稀奇……」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然是因為你，我在擔心你啊。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0653", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「擔心我？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那之後怎麼樣了，有進展嗎？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0654", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼一臉自信滿滿的表情？該不會你……已經爬上大人的階梯了？」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0655", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要耍帥，快說啦！明明昨天還一副要去遠方旅行的眼神。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0656", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太夾住我的脖子，用拳頭對著我的腦袋旋轉攻擊。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你一直陪我商量。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦好啦，以後也要聽我商量喔。」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0657", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？隼太也有煩惱嗎？」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然有啊。多得跟星星一樣、跟大氣中漂浮的灰塵一樣。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0658", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不久後，就輪到他去遙遠國度旅行了吧。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總而言之，恭喜。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0659", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你以為我會這麼單純祝福你嗎？可惡！只有你先爬上大人的階梯！」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0660", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在階梯上，有一個你不知道的廣大世界喔。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇，真的煩死了！給我摔下來！給我從階梯上摔下來！」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 272, "voice": "ht0661", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵～？小熊喵～～？」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1766", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，學姊？」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……新吾君，你有看到小熊喵嗎？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1767", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼說來，今天還沒有看見牠呢。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……跑到哪裡去了呢。平常明明只要叫牠的名字就會出現的……」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1768", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊看著新做好的尾巴飾品，很寂寞地垂著肩膀。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一定是去哪裡散步了吧。」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是那樣的話就好了……但是之前媽媽也說過吧？因為是很稀有的動物，差點被抓走……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1769", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "說的也是。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然相處得太習慣都忘了，但熊喵本來並不是能在這裡看見的動物。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "牠應該是生活在森林深處的動物才對。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1770", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵沒問題的。牠看起來那樣，其實很聰明的。」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，你說的沒錯……」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1771", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在社團等一下吧？」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君時間沒問題嗎？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1772", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為了學姊，就算有問題我也會擠出時間。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸～那樣逞強不好啦～」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1773", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，牽手不太好是吧。或許還有誰留下來……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1774", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這幾天，必須要跟大家說了呢。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1775", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要說出來嗎？應該隱瞞會比較好……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟不可能一直瞞下去，而且……」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1776", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我還是希望我們兩個人能被大家祝福……」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1777", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，我也這麼想。」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很高興。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊決定將我們的關係告訴大家。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是想向誰炫耀。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是在與學姊度過的短暫學校生活中，如果在意周圍的眼光沒辦法相處的話會很寂寞的。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我絕對會讓學姊幸福的。」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也會讓新吾君幸福的喔！」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1778", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我現在就很幸福了說。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要比現在更幸福嘛！」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "mu1779", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也要讓學姊更加更加幸福。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們牽著手，像小孩子一樣拌嘴。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我毫不懷疑與學姊的幸福未來。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──被大家祝福的兩個人……", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能實現就好了呢。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為了能實現，我會與學姊一起走下去。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
